**Fix:** Add a centralized error-handling middleware (must have 4 parameters).
```js
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err.stack); // Log internally
  res.status(err.status || 500).json({
    error: 'An unexpected error occurred.' // Never expose err.message in production
  });
